              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 521&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Line No.: 34&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;Column: e</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">&#8220;Net excess or (deficiency)&#8221; balances are refunded or collected in-kind through White River Hub, LLC&#8217;s Lost-and-Unaccounted For Gas Reimbursement and Tracking provision (&#167;12.14) of the General Terms and Conditions of White River Hub, LLC's FERC Gas Tariff, Original Volume No. 1. Applies to month 2 &amp; 3 also.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
